user.description:
Select a Home Assistant zone — its latitude and longitude are forwarded to the GeoSphere API — and pick which GeoSphere dataset to use. Weather datasets create a weather entity; the air-quality dataset creates sensor entities (NO₂, O₃, PM10, PM2.5).

Dataset documentation:
{doc_links}

reconfigure.description:
Change the zone and/or dataset for this GeoSphere integration. Switching datasets may replace the weather entity with sensor entities (or vice versa).

Dataset documentation:
{doc_links}
